******** Mesh parameters *********
nx             12    // mesh points in x-direction
ny             16    // mesh points in y-direction
nz             16    // mesh points in z-direction

Lx            2.5    // domain size in x-direction
Ly            1.0    // domain size in y-direction
Lz            1.0    // domain size in z-direction

clusterY      3.0    // mesh clustering in y-direction
clusterZ      3.0    // mesh clustering in z-direction

******** Timestepping parameters ********
t_final       0.1    // final time-step
dt           5e-2    // time-step
vis_steps       5    // visualisation step frequency

******** Dimensionless parameters ********
Re            10.0    // Reynolds number
Ha	      10.0    // Hartmann number
